    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Arriving in the Garden
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - SetPanel(Black Death, 1, true)
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroTalkingExpression] The Garden is a place where souls are able
        to rest and bathe in its beauty...'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightDoubtfulExpression] Huh? You mean to rot with the beauty,
        right?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=blackDeathAngryExpression] What you see here are the consequences of
        the boys'' actions to meddle with the world of the dead!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightGoofyExpression] Me! It''s called Ditto Hawkers! (It''s
        Death Work)'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroFrustratedExpression] Again with another name! Stop with that
        nonsense!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroTalkingExpression] Maybe we should try and find you a new brain
        that way you''d stop with making up these absurd names!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/229/Entry/7/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightLaughingExpression] Maybe you should listen more carefully!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Walking Around the Garden
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - None()
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - There are no more living souls here, just these creatures!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Maybe they've escaped?
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/224/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - No, I'm pretty sure that our opponent was able to recruit them to his little
        army to be able to cause even more devastation to this world!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - After some Exploration
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - None()
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroTalkingExpression] No more jokes to tell?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightDoubtfulExpression] It''s just depressing to witness the
        damage done here...'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightDoubtfulExpression] No joke would be able to make this bad
        feeling go away.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroTalkingExpression] So you make jokes to feel better?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightGoofyExpression] Well, in a way.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroSmirkingExpression] Then feel free to do so.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/7/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightGoofyExpression] REEAAAAAAALLLLLYY?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/8/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroFrustratedExpression] NO!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/9/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=crazyKnightDoubtfulExpression] But you said I could!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/225/Entry/10/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroFrustratedExpression] And I regret it!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - After Fighting Some Animals
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - None()
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroTalkingExpression] It seems that one of the Death Lords took
        over this domain.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = crazyKnightGoofyExpression] Interesting! Did you know I''m part Death
        Lord too!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroSmirkingExpression] What''s your name, Joke Lord?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = crazyKnightLaughingExpression] HAHAHA! Thanks so much for revealing
        my true nature!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroTalkingExpression] There are only six Death Lords, we have the
        Black Death who is also called the Reaper, we also have the Lord of the Undead
        World...'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroIdleExpression] And then the other five Death Lords, one of
        them is the Lord of the Animals.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/7/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = crazyKnightDoubtfulExpression] But these creatures do not look like
        animals!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/8/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroTalkingExpression] That''s true, something must have changed
        them as a result of their tormentation.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/226/Entry/9/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = playerFacingAwayExpression] And we will find and kill that cause.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/227/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Defeating Mother Mantis
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/227/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
