      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You're finally back! Were you able to punish all of those Rebels?
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=playerIdleExpression] We''re trying to. It''s only a matter of time
        until we strike down this uprising! Hail to the Black Death!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Hail to the Lord of the Dead!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroFrustratedExpression] Ah, these kinds of religious believers!
        The Lord of the Dead, it''s all a fairy tale!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - If that's what you believe in, it's your belief and not mine.
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroTalkingExpression] Believe whatever you want to believe! Do you
        know anything about the guests arriving here?'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/7/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I believe in things not existing. Anyways, I would say that you'd need to
        be more specific about arriving guests as there's always a lot of people
        that come to Mordenkain!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/8/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=necroFrustratedExpression] Alright, let''s go!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/220/Entry/10/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - May the soul of the Lord of the Dead guide you!
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Entering the Prison
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - None()
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = undeadGeneralAngryExpression] I have to admit, you''re a powerful
        foe! I''ve never met anyone as strong as you!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = playerExcitedExpression] Tell me where your leader is and what he''s
        up to!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = undeadGeneralAngryExpression] You should know by now! He''ll defeat
        the Black Death and free this world from his reign!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = undeadGeneralIdleExpression] However, before we get to that he will
        gather his army and start by striking you down!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroSmirkingExpression] Then how fortunate it is that his trusted
        General is already in custody!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = undeadGeneralAngryExpression] Enough talk! I''d rather rot here in
        prison than to speak with you!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/221/Entry/7/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = playerExcitedExpression] As you wish!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The Black Death Appears
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/0/Title
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - START
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/0/Sequence
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - None()
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = blackDeathAngryExpression] In the Throne Room you will find our enemy!
        Don''t talk to him! He is infested with lies!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = blackDeathIdleExpression] A master of masks! I will banish his magic
        of deception! Kill him and the uprising will come to a halt!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = playerIdleExpression] Yes, Master.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = blackDeathIdleExpression] Don''t disappoint me!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = necroSmirkingExpression] We''ve never failed, and it''ll be staying
        that way.'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/222/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic = blackDeathIdleExpression] HAHAHA! Good, very good my servants! Go
        and serve my purpose!'
      - 
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/193/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - He failed. His mind and soul is split even more now. Do my bidding! Punish
        those who defy me!
      - Er hat versagt. Sein Geist und seine Seele sind jetzt noch mehr gespalten.
        Tun Sie, was ich will! Bestrafe diejenigen, die sich mir widersetzen!
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/194/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Where am I..? What is this place? What happened?
      - "Wo bin ich...? Was ist das f\xFCr ein Ort? Was ist passiert?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/194/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '(in the background, hiding) Hehehehehe...

'
      - '(im Hintergrund, versteckt) Hehehehehe...

'
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - HEY! Pick me up! Get me off this disgusting ground!
      - HEY! Hol mich ab! Holt mich von diesem ekelhaften Boden weg!
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (in your head) Why does picking you up feel like something I'd regret after?
      - "(in deinem Kopf) Warum f\xFChlt es sich so an, als w\xFCrde ich es bereuen,
        wenn ich dich abgeholt habe?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Who was that who just spoke!?
      - Wer war das, der gerade gesprochen hat!?
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - YOUR MOTHER! Hahahaha!
      - Ihre Mutter! Hahahaha!
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - FINALLY! Thanks for finally lifting me up! Careful on your left, the water
        is not safe.
      - ENDLICH! Danke, dass du mich endlich hochgehoben hast! Seien Sie vorsichtig
        auf der linken Seite, das Wasser ist nicht sicher.
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/195/Entry/6/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Let's leave this place now!
      - Lasst uns diesen Ort jetzt verlassen!
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/1/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Do you know who I am?
      - "Wei\xDFt du wer ich bin?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Heh- Of course! You're the Garbage Man!
      - "Heh- Nat\xFCrlich! Du bist der M\xFCllmann!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (singing) Garbage Man... Yeah! Bringing out the trash, Garbage Man... YEAAAH!
        Make every party crash!
      - "(singt) Garbage Man... Yeah! Bring den M\xFCll raus, M\xFCllmann... JAAAAH!
        Bringen Sie jede Party zum Absturz!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/4/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (singing) Garbage Man... Dudududud Dududu GARBAGE MAN..!
      - "(singt) M\xFCllmann... Dudududud Dududu M\xDCLLMANN...!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/5/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You've gone crazy.
      - "Du bist verr\xFCckt geworden."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/8/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Crazy? CRAZY? But I've never been so beautiful before!
      - "Verr\xFCckt? VERR\xDCCKT? Aber so sch\xF6n war ich noch nie!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/9/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Shut up! Who are you anyways!?
      - "Den Mund halten! Wer bist du \xFCberhaupt!?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/10/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I am you, you are me, also I might need to pee.
      - Ich bin du, du bist ich, auch ich muss vielleicht pinkeln.
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/11/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Something strange happened to us. You're the assassin of the Black Death.
      - "Uns ist etwas Seltsames passiert. Du bist der Attent\xE4ter des Schwarzen
        Todes."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/12/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - That rings a bell, but that still seems like a stretch to me, as if I'm someone
        else.
      - "Das kommt mir zwar bekannt vor, aber das kommt mir dennoch \xFCbertrieben
        vor, als w\xE4re ich jemand anderes."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/13/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Why can't I remember how we ended up here?
      - Warum kann ich mich nicht erinnern, wie wir hier gelandet sind?
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/14/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - I don't know, I'm missing a lot of my pages too and I don't know why.
      - "Ich wei\xDF es nicht, mir fehlen auch viele meiner Seiten und ich wei\xDF
        nicht warum."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/15/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - My memory is just as clouded and foggy as yours but I think we need to get
        back to your castle and get help.
      - "Mein Ged\xE4chtnis ist genauso getr\xFCbt und neblig wie Ihres, aber ich
        denke, wir m\xFCssen zu Ihrem Schloss zur\xFCckkehren und Hilfe holen."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/16/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - My castle?
      - Mein Schloss?
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/17/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Yes, in the city of Mordenkain. We have to get across the City of the Dead-
      - "Ja, in der Stadt Mordenkain. Wir m\xFCssen durch die Stadt der Toten gelangen."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/18/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Who the hell are you anyway?
      - "Wer zum Teufel bist du \xFCberhaupt?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/19/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The most powerful and most feared man in the realm of the Undead.
      - "Der m\xE4chtigste und am meisten gef\xFCrchtete Mann im Reich der Untoten."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/20/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - He was right, he is you. A part of you. Maybe by finding my missing pages
        we'd know what happened!
      - "Er hatte recht, er ist du. Ein Teil von dir. Vielleicht w\xFCssten wir,
        was passiert ist, wenn wir meine fehlenden Seiten finden!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/196/Entry/21/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - HELL YEAH! Can't Wait! Party time!
      - "H\xD6LLE JA! Ich kann es kaum erwarten! Partyzeit!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/81/Description
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Player Tries to go to the Pier but Store advised  him against it
      - Der Spieler versucht, zum Pier zu gehen, aber Store hat ihm davon abgeraten
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/81/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
