    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/58/Entry/2/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - (in your head) Why does picking you up feel like something I'd regret after?
      - "(in deinem Kopf) Warum f\xFChlt es sich so an, als w\xFCrde ich es bereuen,
        wenn ich dich abgeholt habe?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Dialogue System/Conversation/58/Entry/3/Dialogue Text
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '[pic=playerExcitedExpression] Who was that who just spoke!?

'
